$ bof3 assets import sprite-sheet --help
[exit 0]
bof3 assets import sprite-sheet: read a PNG sheet and Aseprite JSON back into a sprite bank.

Usage: bof3 assets import sprite-sheet JSON --payload PAYLOAD --exe SLUS_004.22 [-o OUT]

  JSON                Aseprite JSON from export sprite-sheet; the PNG it names sits next to it
      --payload PATH  the stored payload it was exported from (required)
      --exe PATH      the executable, which holds the cell sizes (required)
  -o, --output OUT    payload to write, stored like PAYLOAD (default: JSON.bin)

Example:
  bof3 assets import sprite-sheet ryu.json --payload PL012-3.lz77 --exe SLUS_004.22 -o PL012-3.new.lz77

$ bof3 assets kinds
[exit 0]
executable       raw       program images: SLUS_004.22 and LOGO.EXE
system           raw       SYSTEM.CNF and the license sectors
video            raw       MDEC video with XA audio (2336-byte sectors)
xa-audio         raw       multiplexed XA ADPCM banks (2336-byte sectors)
cdda             decoded   CD-DA tracks: the stored 16-bit stereo PCM and a 44.1 kHz WAV
texture          decoded   type-3 VRAM uploads: raw words and a 16bpp PNG view
palette          decoded   CLUT banks: raw words, JSON and a swatch PNG
audio-bank       decoded   VAB header (.vh) and body (.vb) halves, and a SoundFont 2 (.sf2) per bank
audio-sequence   raw       SEP sequence packages (.seq)
audio-cues       decoded   type-8 cue tables: raw records and JSON
character-bank   decoded   sprite banks: stored form and, for type 1, the LZ77-decoded blob
area-message     raw       area message banks (0x80010000)
area-cells       raw       packed 4-bit cell grids (0x80032000)
area-script      decoded   area script banks (0x800D3800): stored bytes, JSON and the ops as text
battle-script    decoded   battle script banks (0x800F0800): stored bytes, JSON and the ops as text
area-actor-defs  decoded   actor definitions: raw records and JSON
area-encounters  decoded   encounters and enemy records (0x800E4000): stored bytes and JSON
area-map         decoded   map bundles (0x80104000): stored bytes and the terrain as OBJ, MTL and glTF binary
area-module      raw       auxiliary module windows (0x80117000)
resource-table   raw       shared resource tables (0x8001A000)
bmagic-table     decoded   magic-effect script banks (0x800C3800): stored bytes, JSON and the ops as text
code             raw       code images loaded from EMI entries
reserve          none      all-zero payloads that reserve a RAM slot
unknown          raw       entries and files no rule classifies
data-table       decoded   fixed game tables from ETC/GAME.EMI entry 0: stored bytes and JSON for items, equipment, shops, abilities, level growth
text             decoded   game strings and message banks as JSON, from the extracted disc

